     3782                 for each orig_marking-lines no-lock where orig_marking-lines.gds-code   = buf_goods.gds-code
     3783                                                       and orig_marking-lines.obj-type   = archive_parts.obj-type
     3784                                                       and orig_marking-lines.obj-code   = archive_parts.obj-code
